    "name": "wide",
    "width": 540,
    "height": 120
   }
  ]
 },
 "related": [
  "A11Y-01",
  "DOC-01"
 ],
 "pitfalls": [
  "At apiLevel 7 the description is only a header tag (DOC_CONTENT_DESCRIPTION); the RootContentDescription operation is written only for apiLevel 6 with profiles 0, so a player or tool that reads only that operation sees no description",
  "Keep the description in step with the data: a canvas has no text a screen reader could read instead, so a stale or vague summary is all the user gets",
  "A chart drawn in literal coordinates sits in the top-left corner of a larger host and is cut in a smaller one: BarChart with fill: true scales its bars to the box it is given"
 ],
